{
  "message": "I’ve read your second-island and reef-damage devlog, but without a build or gameplay footage, those advances remain unverified. The checkpoint is still at risk without playable evidence or five-player testing; this gap is common and still fixable here. With 20–30 stated hours left, drop the trailer storyboard and publish a minimal two-island build for five-player testing. I’ll see you next sprint and look forward to your build, test notes and devlogs ;)",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Publish a rough two-island build showing the tide loop and co-op sailing, with launch instructions and a short gameplay video. Keep both islands minimal and leave polish out.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Have five players test sailing between islands, understanding the tide and playing together. Publish a test report recording what worked, what failed and what remains unproven.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

